  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research, Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning.The programme is piloting an adaptive approach. Funds are used to collect data on the current approach to devolution to influence the design/implementation of this and future programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Research, Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning.The programme is piloting an adaptive approach. Funds are used to collect data on the current approach to devolution to influence the design/implementation of this and future programmes is a component of Kenya Devolution Support Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;480,633. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Decentralisation and support to subnational government, Public sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
